## Keep English (proper names)

Never translate place names (`StrSheet_Region`, `StrSheet_ZoneName`): Isolated Town, Island of Dawn, Velika, Oblivion Woods, etc.
Never translate monster names (`StrSheet_Creature` `name=`): Argon Predator, Slinking Sabertooths.

## Quest (`StrSheet_Quest`)

- Window title AND the NPC F-row (`id >= 1000` and `id % 1000 == 1`): English only.
- F-buttons: English only (quoted and unquoted parchment choices).
- System chrome `id < 1000`: English only.
- Journal descriptions: `[EN]…<br>[ES]…` without Transcription credit.
- NPC parchment body is `QuestDialog` / `VillagerDialog`, not StrSheet_Quest.

## UI (`StrSheet_UI`)

Compact `English/Spanish`. Never translate prices or separators: `$005006` is `,` (thousands). Hash in UI is color.

